                                        "text": "\nprivate fun safeFileName(title: String, url: String): String {\n    val ext = Uri.parse(url).lastPathSegment.orEmpty().substringAfterLast('.', \"mp4\")\n        .take(8).lowercase().takeIf { it.matches(Regex(\"[a-z0-9]{1,8}\")) } ?: \"mp4\"\n    val base = title.replace(Regex(\"[^\\\\p{L}\\\\p{N}._ -]+\"), \"_\").trim().take(80).ifBlank { \"video\" }\n"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
